cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Julia Time, please cite it as below."
title: "Julia Time: a local, single-player game for learning Julia through data and probability"
abstract: >-
  A locally-run browser game in which the player types real Julia and the screen answers:
  six connected investigation chapters on simulated water-flea records, data handling,
  sampling, simulation, and careful interpretation.
type: software
